---
/**
 * Architecture Section
 *
 * About page section highlighting Chassis' architecture, with stats and links to GitHub and contribution guidelines.
 */
---

<section class="about-section overflow-hidden py-3xlarge py-medium-6xlarge">
  <div class="container-2xlarge">
    <div class="row g-medium g-large-3xlarge">
      <div class="font-large col-12 col-large-6">
        <h2>Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Chassis is five packages built on a shared foundation: design tokens, a Figma component library, a CSS
          framework, an asset distributor, and an icon pipeline.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each package is independently useful and can be adopted on its own. Together, they
          connect design decisions in Figma to production code.
        </p>
        <p>
          All five are MIT-licensed. Clone them, adapt them, and use them as the foundation of
          your own design system — your tokens, your brands, your platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-large-6 pt-large-6xlarge">
        <div class="row g-medium">
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xlarge">
              <p class="font-4xlarge font-mass fg-primary m-0">5</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">packages</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xlarge">
              <p class="font-4xlarge font-mass fg-primary m-0">MIT</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">licensed</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xlarge">
              <p class="font-4xlarge font-mass fg-primary m-0">W3C</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">compatible</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xlarge">
              <p class="font-4xlarge font-mass fg-primary m-0">3+</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">platforms</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
